        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: European School, Munich; European Schools\n- Places: Germany; Munich; Bavaria; Neuperlach; Perlach; Perlacher Haid\n- Topics: school establishment; urban development\n\nFacts:\n- Neuperlach was built starting in 1967 east of the former village of Perlach on the ground of the former Perlacher Haid.\n- The European School, Munich was first established in 1977.\n- In 1981, the European School, Munich moved to its current location in Neuperlach in the south-east of Munich, Bavaria.\n- The European School, Munich is one of thirteen European Schools and one of three in Germany.\n- Neuperlach is a borough in the south-east of Munich, the capital of Bavaria, and is part of city district number 16, Perlach.",
